          "choices": [],
          "correct_choice_ids": [],
          "answer": "A: 你想吃一点东西吗？ (Nǐ xiǎng chī yìdiǎn dōngxi ma?) — Would you like something to eat?\nB: 我不想吃，谢谢。 (Wǒ bù xiǎng chī, xièxie.) — I do not want to eat, thank you.\nA: 你想喝一点茶吗？ (Nǐ xiǎng hē yìdiǎn chá ma?) — Would you like some tea?\nB: 好，我想喝一点茶。 (Hǎo, wǒ xiǎng hē yìdiǎn chá.) — Yes, I would like some tea.",
          "explanation": "Complete sample role-play. Practise both speakers, then substitute your own details."
        }
      ]
    }
